        "content": "**API · OpenTelemetry metrics** (from `eve-industry-planner/shared/telemetry/apimetrics`). Metrics are exposed by the collector OTLP → Prometheus scrape on `:8889`.\n\n**Auth naming:** `eve_token_login` = POST `/auth/login` with EVE access token → app JWT. `session_refresh` = POST `/auth/refresh` (app refresh token + EVE token). `eve_sso_code_exchange` / `eve_sso_token_refresh` = EVE OAuth with CCP (code exchange vs refresh token).\n\n**Latency** histograms record **milliseconds** (`DurationMilliseconds`) so they align with the OTel SDK default bucket boundaries (0, 5, 10, 25, …) and `histogram_quantile` stays meaningful.\n\nPanels use `rate(...[$__rate_interval])`. Pick **Last 15 minutes** or wider and generate API traffic; idle periods show **0 req/s** on rate charts.\n\nIf names differ slightly, use **Explore → Prometheus → Metrics browser** (OTel sanitizes `.` → `_`).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
